            "value" : "Region Capture lets you select part of your screen and ask about it. To take that screenshot, Conduck needs Screen Recording access.\n\nIf System Settings already shows Conduck as on, turn it off and on again, then quit and reopen Conduck.\n\nYour screenshot and your words are sent only to the AI gateway you configured — nowhere else."
